+ownership. VME in ISRs or without registration is unsupported. Later affinity
+changes including hart 2 are rejected. All three OS harts remain active.
 
-### What runs where
+The explicit patched-kernel context stress and mixed three-hart application
+passed source-model functional checks. These do not establish RTL/FPGA Zephyr
+qualification. The explicit compiled-operation workflow below invokes the target setup hook.
+The generic Merlin whole-model worker pool still lacks that hook.
 
